PaymentRailsFactory_Registry
├── given no instances deployed
│   ├── it should return false for isDeployedInstance
│   ├── it should return empty array for getDeployedInstances
│   └── it should return zero for getInstanceCount
├── given instances deployed
│   ├── it should return true for deployed instances
│   ├── it should return false for non-deployed addresses
│   ├── it should return correct array for getDeployedInstances
│   └── it should return correct count for getInstanceCount
└── given mix of CREATE and CREATE2 deployments
    └── it should track both in the same registry
